      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَسْفَحٌ</span></b>  <i>A place where water is poured out,</i> or
<i>forth;</i> and <i>where blood,</i> and <i>tears, are shed:</i> pl.
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَسَافِحُ</span>.] One says, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لِلْوَادِى مَسَافِحُ</span> <i>The valley has
places where it pours out,</i> or <i>forth.</i> (A, TA.)

